<script setup lang="ts">import {computed} from 'vue';import {fmt} from '../utils/format';const p=defineProps<{result:any;stale:boolean}>();const rows=computed(()=>p.result?.series||[]);</script><template><section class="posterior-grid live-series"><div class="section-head"><h2>每个位置只依据到此为止的前缀。</h2><span>前向递推 log α / 无后向平滑 / 不使用未来观测</span></div><div class="posterior-scroll"><div class="posterior-table" :style="{minWidth:Math.max(560,rows.length*30+180)+'px'}"><div class="posterior-row" v-for="(state,s) in result.states" :key="state"><strong>{{s}} / {{state}}</strong><span v-for="row in rows" :key="row.position" class="posterior-cell" :style="{backgroundColor:'oklch(78% .08 88 / '+row.posterior[s]+')'}" :title="'位置'+row.position+'，修订'+row.observation_revision+'：'+fmt(row.posterior[s],8)"><small v-if="rows.length<=14" :style="{color:row.posterior[s]>.6?'var(--ink)':'var(--paper)'}">{{fmt(row.posterior[s],3)}}</small></span></div></div></div><div class="live-loglik"><span v-for="row in rows" :key="row.position"><small>t{{row.position}} / {{row.token}}</small>{{fmt(row.cumulative_log_likelihood,5)}}</span></div><p>第t列的颜色是该前缀的滤波后验；累计logL同样只到第t位。后向平滑会用到未来码，实时会话刻意不做。</p></section></template>
